1104:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_AbortCpltCallback()
1105:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_AbortTransmitCpltCallback()
