1121:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****        (+) Error is considered as Blocking : Transfer could not be completed properly and is aborte
1122:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****            This concerns Overrun Error In Interrupt mode reception and all errors in DMA mode.
1123:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****            Error code is set to allow user to identify error type, and HAL_UART_ErrorCallback()
1124:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****            user callback is executed.
