2732:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_EnableReceiverTimeout() API enables the receiver timeout feature
2733:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_DisableReceiverTimeout() API disables the receiver timeout feature
